Identify this image. If it is an animation storyboard with frame numbers and timestamps, read left to right, then top to bottom, following changes in actions, expressions and captions; do not treat each panel as a separate person or event.
Return only JSON: {{"description":"content description","emoji_tags":["emotion or usage scenario"]}}. In description, use up to 60 English words to explain the subject, action sequence, visible text and intended meaning; for a still image describe what is visible. Supply up to 5 main emotion, tone or common usage tags in emoji_tags, or an empty array for an ordinary image without such meaning. Do not add Markdown or other content.
